byebyedpi

gpl v2, see LICENSE.

the telegram gateway follows the method of tg-ws-proxy by Flowseal (mit,
licenses/tg-ws-proxy-MIT.txt) as used in ByeByeDPI x tg by EwenLoy. the code
here is written from the protocol, not copied.

byebyetlsfix is the tls shim of senko (senkotlsfix, gpl v2), see byebyetlsfix/VENDOR. it
carries mbedtls 3.6 (apache 2.0 or gpl 2 or later, licenses/mbedtls-LICENSE.txt).

the tunnel layer in daemon/tun is vendored from senko (gpl v2), see
daemon/tun/VENDOR. it carries lwip 2.2.1 (bsd 3 clause,
daemon/tun/third_party/lwip/COPYING).

the trust roots in the package are the pem bundle given as BYE_CA_BUNDLE_SRC
when the deb is built.

the domain lists under app/lists start from the test lists of ByeByeDPI for
android by romanvht (gpl v3), and the youtube, discord, telegram, social,
tiktok, cloudflare, spotify, twitch and github lists add names from
domain-list-community by v2fly (mit, licenses/domain-list-community-MIT.txt),
without its ads entries.

the glyphs in art/icons/material are Material Symbols (apache 2.0,
art/LICENSE-MaterialSymbols.txt). the other glyphs and the app icon are drawn
for this project.
